Community Material icon mapping and original font

This mapping is derived from com.mikepenz:community-material-typeface:7.0.96.1-kotlin.
It contains all 7,134 original cmd names/code units, in original order. The original
font remains supplied by that same AAR dependency; the lightweight provider does
not replace or modify the font.

Original code attribution: Copyright 2020 Mike Penz.
The original CommunityMaterial.kt header, lines 1-15, states Apache License 2.0
and links to http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0 . The published POM also
names Apache-2.0 and https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0.txt .

Upstream font metadata is retained as published, including its differing wording:
- AAR res/values/values.xml: library_MaterialDesignIcons_licenseId = sil_ofl_1_1;
  author Austin Andrews, library Material Design Icons, year 2022.
- CommunityMaterial.kt provider properties: author Templarian / Community / Google;
  license Pictogrammers Free License;
  licenseUrl https://github.com/Templarian/MaterialDesign/blob/master/LICENSE .
These are the original artifact's separate code/font/provider declarations. This
notice records them without relabeling the font or replacing existing attribution.
No standalone font license text is embedded in the inspected AAR; the locations
above identify the supplied metadata and original license-reference text.

