All current glyphs are BMP U+A001..U+BBDE, without surrogate code units. A future
supplementary-plane mapping requires a string-capable API, not Char truncation.
The offline generator accepts only the source-jar SHA above and performs no download.

To verify the checked-in mapping without changing it:
python3 script/quality/generate_community_material_glyphs.py --source-jar SOURCE_JAR --output app/src/main/res/raw/community_material_glyphs.tsv --check
